---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lang = Astro.currentLocale || 'en';
const prefix = lang === 'en' ? '' : `/${lang}`;
---

<Layout title="Bio-Electric Fields as Sentience Substrates (WIP)">
  <article class="py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-[#9966CC] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Research Track 01 — Working Progress</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Bio-Electric Fields as Sentience Substrates</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 italic mb-12">Emulating Michael Levin’s framework for morphological intelligence.</p>
    <div class="prose prose-slate">
      <p>This research explores the hypothesis that cellular bio-electric networks act as the fundamental substrate of cognition. By moving beyond neural-centric models, we investigate how morphological decision-making in non-neural organisms provides the primitive building blocks of awareness.</p>
      <p><em>Content pending development.</em></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
